<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu eases to 4.6035 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu eases to 4.6035 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.6035 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6002 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					 Oct 2		   Oct 1</p>
<p>    lei per dollar		 4.6035		  4.6002</p>
<p>    volume traded ($)	    30,000		  800,000</p>
<p>    lei per 1,000 roubles	0.8465		  0.8515</p>
<p>    volume traded (rbls million)   250		     100</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
